Rāma wakes LakṣmaṆa to forest cries at parting time --- Brothers touch river water and take sage path --- Rāma shows flaming Kiṃśukas after frost --- Shows fruit-bowed Bhallātakas promising life --- Shows bee-honey drōṇas with natyūha and peacock --- Rāma shows elephant-haunted bird-loud rising Chitrakūṭa --- Reaches hill and bids fetch strong timber --- LakṣmaṆa builds hut and offers antelope into fire --- Rāma bathes prays and makes oblation as all enter hut like gods --- Rejoice on Mālyavatī freed from exile sorrow
